cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "BraTS-PED 2026 (Task 2) — Pediatric Brain Tumor Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, containerized deep-learning pipeline for Task 2 of the
  MICCAI BraTS-PED 2026 challenge: skull-stripping, a residual-encoder
  nnU-Net v2 (3D full-resolution) 5-fold ensemble, and lesion-wise
  post-processing for voxel-wise segmentation of four pediatric
  brain-tumor sub-regions (ET, NET, CC, ED) from multi-parametric MRI.
